ISO-10303-21;
/* Os020: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing a CIRCLE (profile radius=3) and a B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS (tight 3D helix-approximation spine); profile diameter (6) exceeds helix local curvature radius (~4) — evolved swept surface self-intersects (folds over); BRepOffsetAPI_MakeEvolved self-intersection along spine; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; no orphaned entities */
HEADER;
